  "system": {
    "identifier": "futton-boil-release-steam-bullet",
    "description": "<p>You expel a powerful bullet of acid from your body. Make a ranged ninjutsu attack against a creature within range, dealing 4d8 acid damage on a hit and forcing the target to make a constitution saving throw.</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creature is able to resist this jutsu’s effects.</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creature gains 1 rank of Deteriorate or Scaled, your choice.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Same as failure and they are also Blinded from the intense steam.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d8. If this jutsu is cast at C-Rank or higher, increase the ranks of Deteriorate or Scaled by +1. If this jutsu it cast at B-Rank or higher increase the number of creatures you can target by +1. If this jutsu is cast at A-Rank or higher, increase the ranks of Deteriorate or Scaled by +1. If this jutsu it cast at S-Rank increase the number of creatures you can target by +1.</p>",
